{"id": "DfRn1vYy8jy", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Jisne Ravan ko marte dekha tha, wahi Jambavan, Dwapar mein Ram ko pehchaan kyun nahi paaya? Ek chamakti mani, ek jhootha kalank, aur ek andheri gufa.\n\nSyamantak mani, Prasen, sher aur Jambavan ki katha Shrimad Bhagavatam 10.56 mein hai. Jambavan ki Ram se bal parakhne ki ichchha Bhagavatam mein nahi likhi, yeh parampara se aati hai, isliye humne \"kehte hain\" kaha.\n\nPart 2 mein: woh ladai jo din-raat nahi ruki.\n\nAap jaante the ki Krishna par bhi chori ka kalank laga tha?\n\n#krishna #jaishreeram🚩 #shrikrishna #ramayana #diwali", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793700321, "like_count": 371712, "comment_count": 507, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1159363783448189a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 69.965, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPQKC5CDMsQ09ZeFArW01glmWyENcUe6H_cy1nCZCePhSCD438hmBo5v-DhCPy4ND8odhjdwVJHm0cThjrUw_N9q4QHj5UL8CmSN24.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdpVTtUEuqP4VBXtM3Dc9aAFTbIYJRp2gro4IU7BCwc8yXZgjMV-JEHMilCR8PlinN7hNpmEz04CphIydctMvYwP&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=2yUUeDKJrtQQ7kNvwFcyku1&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Erd9xWx1tsJf8ZKPlosByw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSJSX7q1GZOo5HI-XA-xSUXbp61TCZLRiN8LOxmWuJc-g&oe=6AF45165", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 69.965, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode"